            "sid": "1SA 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.23.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 23:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Saulo ku yaatabaarukire naaruga kubinga Abafilistia, abantu baamugira bati: Reeba, Daudi ari omu ihamba rya Eni-geedi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo nikwo kutoorana engabo enkumi ishatu omuri Israeli yoona, akazitwara, akaza kusherura Daudi n'abantu be aha nkiri z'aha izaagiriro ry'enzaza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku yaahikire aha ngombe z'entaama ezaabaire ziri aha rubaju rw'omuhanda, yaashangaho enyanga, yaagitaahamu kuza aha ishaazi. Kandi Daudi n'abashaija be bakaba bari hare omunda y'egyo nyanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.26.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 26:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Abashaija ba Daudi baamugira bati: Eri niryo izooba eri MUKAMA yaakugambiire naagira ati: Reeba, ndyahayo omuzigu waawe omu mikono yaawe, omugire nk'oku orikwenda. Bwanyima Daudi yaimuka, yaagyenda naashooba, yaashara aha mukugiro gw'omunagiro gwa Saulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka ku yaaherize kukora atyo, yaashinjwa omu mutima ahabw'okushara ahari ogwo munagiro; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.26.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 26:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOB.31.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yob 31:29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOB.31.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " yaagira abashaija be ati: Nikikabure nyowe okukora ntyo mukama wangye, ou MUKAMA yaashukireho amajuta, okumubangira omukono, haza MUKAMA yaamushukireho amajuta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.7.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 7:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.12.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 12:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Atyo Daudi yaazibira abashaija be, tiyaabaikiriza kwita Saulo. Bwanyima Saulo yaimuka, yaaruga omu nyanga, yaagyenda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima Daudi nawe yaimuka, yaaruga omu nyanga, yaayeta Saulo naagira ati: Nyakusinga mukama wangye. Saulo ku yaagarwire amaisho enyima, Daudi yainama, yaamutangirira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi yaabuuza Saulo ati: Ahabw'enki noohurira ebi abantu barikukugambira ngu, Daudi naayenda kukukora kubi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu tiwaayereebera ku MUKAMA yaaba akuhaireyo omu mikono yangye eri izooba, obu waaba ori omu nyanga? Nangwa hariho abamwe abangambira kukwita, kwonka nyowe naakusaasira, naagira nti: Tindikwija kugorora mukono gwangye ahari mukama wangye, ahakuba niwe MUKAMA yaashukireho amajuta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.23.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 23:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi Taata, reeba omukugiro gw'omunagiro gwawe; nk'oku naashara omukugiro gw'omunagiro gwawe, ntakwite, ekyo kikumanyise kandi oreebe ku hatariho kibi nari obugomi omuriinye; kandi ku ntakakucumurahoga, n'obu oraabe otuura noohiiga amagara gangye kugaihaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOB.5.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yob 5:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " MUKAMA abe niwe yaatucwera orubanja twembi, kandi abe niwe yaakumpoorera; kwonka omukono gwangye gurekye kuba nigwo gwakwita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nk'oku enfumu y'aba kare egira eti, Ebibi biruga omu babi; kwonka omukono gwangye tigurikukoraho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beitu omugabe wa Israeli aizire kuteera oha? Ou ohiigire n'oha? Ohiigire embwa efiire, ohiigire omura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.35.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 35:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " N'ahabw'ekyo MUKAMA abe omuramuzi waitu twembi, atucwere orubanja, areebe, antonganire, akunjune. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.26.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 26:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Daudi ku yaaherize kugambira Saulo ebigambo ebyo, Saulo yaagira ati: Mwana wangye Daudi, eryo n'eiraka ryawe? Saulo yaayeha eboroogo, yaarira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.9.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kur 9:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yaagaruka yaagira Daudi ati: Wankiza okuhikiirira; ahakuba waanyihura ebirungi, haza nyowe nkwihwire ebibi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi eri izooba waayoreka butunu ku wankora gye, ahabw'okuba tiwaanyita n'obu MUKAMA yampayo omu mikono yaawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Noogira ngu omuntu akaareeba omuzigu we, amureka, agyenda? N'ahabw'ekyo MUKAMA akuzimuurire ebirungi ahabw'eki wankorera eri izooba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi reeba, hati nimmanya ku otaribura kuba omugabe, n'obugabe bwa Israeli ku burihamibwa omu mikono yaawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'ahabw'ekyo ndahira MUKAMA ku otaricwekyereza ruzaaro rwangye naarugaho, kandi ku otarimaraho iziina ryangye omu nju ya tata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi yaamurahira. Saulo yaagaruka owe; kwonka Daudi yainamuka yaagaruka omu kigo n'abantu be.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
